<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 29.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Villa World	     10.78    1.02</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 3 Prop Income Inv	 10.06    1.01</p>
<p> 4 Aust Tour		 10.00    0.75</p>
<p> 5 McIntosh Sec	     9.89    0.91</p>
<p> 6 BT Prop Trust	    9.71    1.68</p>
<p> 7 Indu Property	    9.68    0.94</p>
<p> 8 Colonial Mutual	  9.28    1.14</p>
<p> 9 Central Equity	   9.09    0.99</p>
<p>10 Armstrong Retail	 8.92    0.74</p>
<p>11 Centro Prop		8.82    2.21</p>
<p>12 Gen Prop Tr		8.78    2.29</p>
<p>13 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.67    0.90</p>
<p>14 Barclays Mirvac	  8.66    1.27</p>
<p>15 Advance Pro CB	   8.47    1.37</p>
